# Never commit the Ed25519 signing key. Only `public.pem` is intended to be
# shared (in the Caido store submission); the private key belongs in a
# GitHub Actions secret named PRIVATE_KEY.
private.pem
private_key.pem
*.pem

# Local working notes kept out of a public repo. Ignored rather than merely
# untracked so a stray `git add -A` cannot publish them.
IMPROVEMENT-PLAN.md

# Tee'd output of the Phase 3 Windows probe, produced by any local
# `node scripts/windows-llrt-probe.mjs 2>&1 | tee probe-results.txt` run and by
# a downloaded copy of the CI artifact. Ignored rather than merely untracked so
# a stray `git add -A` cannot publish it. No leading slash, so a copy landing in
# a subdirectory is covered too. The durable record is the committed findings
# document in the phase directory, not this file — the CI copy expires.
probe-results.txt
